,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","number":25,"title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":343,"closed_issues":2335,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T06:28:22Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-06-16T12:42:01Z","updated_at":"2026-06-22T17:34:37Z","closed_at":"2026-06-22T17:34:14Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in 3.0.stable, 4.0.stable, 4.7.rc3\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 10\n\n### Issue description\n\n`Control::set_size()` does not respect the growth directions for uncontained `Control` nodes. This can either be achieved via code (which led to #120167 for example) or simply by setting the size using the editor GUI. \n\nIn the example below, the `Control` (which is child of `Control` scene auto-generated by selecting the \"User Interface\" option in new scene creation) had a size of `40,40`, was given the \"Center\" anchor preset, and then had its size increased to `100,40`, and just grew to the right instead of in both directions. \n\n<img width=\"848\" height=\"172\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/738fddd1-effc-4fe3-8314-0228e020dbd6\" />\n\nRe-setting the anchor using the toolbar to centered fixes the issue.\n<sub> I guess this is a small bug too, it only works with toolbar but not the inspector setting </sub>\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Add a control\n- Set its growth directions to something other than the default (via any preset that isn't \"Top-Left\")\n- Increase its size\n--> Grows in the wrong direction\n- Re-set the anchoring to the same thing using the toolbar\n--> Fixes the issue\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nThe MRP has a centered `Control` of size `40,40` that has \"Center\" anchor, setting it to `100,40` reproduces the conditions in the description above.\n\n[control_set_size_anchors_MRP.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/29001680/control_set_size_anchors_MRP.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120345/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120345/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}